Sharks are present, but they rarely attack man. Most sharks feare him and tend to keep away.
Saltwater crocodile habitat consists mainly of river estuaries north of Rockhampton, not actively living them in the ocean.
Booking in advance, the traveler has the serenity to find a place to sleep once he arrives at his destination.
Travel agencies often stipulate conventions with certain hotels, but it is still possible to book other forms of accommodation, such as campsites, through the same agencies.
Travel agencies generally offer packages including breakfast, transfers to/from the airport or even combined flight+hotel packages.
They can also keep the reservation for you if you need time to think about the offer or to obtain additional documents necessary for your destination (e.g. the visa).
However, any changes or requests must be submitted to the travel agent first and not directly to the hotel.
On the occasion of some music festivals, most of the participants decide to camp on site, considering this aspect a crucial element of experience.
To be close to the center of the action you need to arrive early and clinch a space close to music.
Remember that once the music is finished on the main stages, there could be sections of the festival where the music lasts until late at night.
Some festivals have special camping areas for families with small children.
If you cross the Northern Baltic Sea in winter, check the location of the cabin, since the crossing of the ice causes rather annoying noises for those most exposed.
